{"data":{"current_mention_tongjian_id":"8c438072-db0e-11ef-b55f-a0d3651f611f","current_paragraph_tongjian_id":"8c438061-db0e-11ef-b1a0-a0d3651f611f","occurrence_page":{"anchor_paragraph_order":0,"current_page":1,"items":[{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"丹","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"爲，于僞翻；下同。","note_content_jianti_auto":"为，于伪翻；下同。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":32,"tongjian_id":"982a2479-db0e-11ef-ab59-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"袁紹","people_name_jianti_auto":"袁绍","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"982a247b-db0e-11ef-afb3-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"勃海","place_name_jianti_auto":"勃海","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"982a247c-db0e-11ef-b44b-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"勃海，謂袁紹也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"勃海，谓袁绍也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":52,"tongjian_id":"982a247a-db0e-11ef-a29b-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"袁術","people_name_jianti_auto":"袁术","start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"982a247f-db0e-11ef-94ba-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"丹水","place_name_jianti_auto":"丹水","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"982a2480-db0e-11ef-a5c1-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"析縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"析县","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"982a2481-db0e-11ef-ab6d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"弘農郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"弘农郡","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"982a2482-db0e-11ef-ba64-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"此謂袁術也。丹水及析縣皆屬弘農郡。","note_content_jianti_auto":"此谓袁术也。丹水及析县皆属弘农郡。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":94,"tongjian_id":"982a247e-db0e-11ef-8744-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"操","people_name_jianti_auto":"操","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"982a2484-db0e-11ef-b1ce-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"觀操之計，但欲形格勢禁，待其變起於下耳，非主於戰也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"观操之计，但欲形格势禁，待其变起于下耳，非主于战也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":130,"tongjian_id":"982a2483-db0e-11ef-89fa-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"袁紹","people_name_jianti_auto":"袁绍","start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"982a2486-db0e-11ef-aec1-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"從袁紹也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"从袁绍也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":188,"tongjian_id":"982a2485-db0e-11ef-acd4-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"丹","place_name_jianti_auto":"丹","start_index":86,"tongjian_id":"982a2494-db0e-11ef-a9ea-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":[],"content":"操到酸棗，諸軍十餘萬，日置酒高會，不圖進取，操責讓之，因爲謀曰：「諸君能聽吾計，使勃海引河內之衆臨孟津，酸棗諸將守成皋，據敖倉，塞轘轅、太谷，全制其險，使袁將軍率南陽之軍軍丹、析，入武關，以震三輔，皆高壘深壁，勿與戰，益爲疑兵，示天下形勢，以順誅逆，可立定也。今兵以義動，持疑不進，失天下望，竊爲諸君恥之！」邈等不能用。操乃與司馬沛國夏侯惇等詣揚州，募兵，得千餘人，還屯河內。","content_fanyi":"曹操来到酸枣，见各路军队十余万人，每天设酒宴大会，不思进取。曹操责备他们，并替他们谋划说：“诸位如果能听从我的计策，就请勃海太守袁绍率领河内的兵众进逼孟津，酸枣的各位将领坚守成皋，占据敖仓，封锁轘辕、太谷，全部控制这些险要，让袁术将军统率南阳的军队驻扎到丹水、析县，攻入武关，从而震动三辅。各军都高筑壁垒，不与敌人交战，多设疑兵，向天下展示大军压境之势，依顺大义讨伐叛逆，便可立即平定。如今军队凭大义而起，却迟疑不向前，使天下人失望，我私下替诸位感到羞耻！”张邈等人没有采用。曹操于是与司马、沛国人夏侯惇等人前往扬州招募士兵，募得一千余人，回军屯驻河内。","content_jianti_auto":"操到酸枣，诸军十余万，日置酒高会，不图进取，操责让之，因为谋曰：「诸君能听吾计，使勃海引河内之众临孟津，酸枣诸将守成皋，据敖仓，塞轘辕、太谷，全制其险，使袁将军率南阳之军军丹、析，入武关，以震三辅，皆高垒深壁，勿与战，益为疑兵，示天下形势，以顺诛逆，可立定也。今兵以义动，持疑不进，失天下望，窃为诸君耻之！」邈等不能用。操乃与司马沛国夏侯惇等诣扬州，募兵，得千余人，还屯河内。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[{"excerpts":[{"context_after":"当斯时，操固未有擅天下之心可知也。以操为早有擅天下之心者...","context_before":"...之时，一战而天下定。”使一战而天下定，操其能独有天下乎？","source_end_index":92,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"4bf1b6de-32be-4483-a66b-0562a6ff2e51","source_start_index":58,"source_text":"既败于荥阳，且劝张邈等勿得迟疑不进，失天下望，而邈等不用，操乃还军。"}],"title":"一 曹操孙坚讨董卓时并无窥窃心"}],"id":5165,"path":"资治通鉴 : 卷第五十九 (漢記五十一) / 孝獻皇帝甲 / 初平元年 / 第 15 段","reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"982a2478-db0e-11ef-80c1-a0d3651f611f","year_int":190},"tongjian_id":"982a2478-db0e-11ef-80c1-a0d3651f611f"},"paragraph_order":1},{"mention_count":1,"paragraph_brief":{"brief_for":"丹","paragraph":{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"力將，卽亮翻；下同。夏，戶雅翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"力将，即亮翻；下同。夏，户雅翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":32,"tongjian_id":"b8f8eaf1-db0e-11ef-971b-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"河","place_name_jianti_auto":"河","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"b8f8eaf3-db0e-11ef-9c5e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"北河","place_name_jianti_auto":"北河","start_index":4,"tongjian_id":"b8f8eaf4-db0e-11ef-ba8e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"朔方","place_name_jianti_auto":"朔方","start_index":10,"tongjian_id":"b8f8eaf5-db0e-11ef-9fba-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"新秦","place_name_jianti_auto":"新秦","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"b8f8eaf6-db0e-11ef-83a1-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"河南者，北河之南，卽朔方、新秦之地。","note_content_jianti_auto":"河南者，北河之南，即朔方、新秦之地。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":55,"tongjian_id":"b8f8eaf2-db0e-11ef-a138-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"延陀","people_name_jianti_auto":"延陀","start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"b8f8eaf9-db0e-11ef-9f72-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"眞珠","people_name_jianti_auto":"真珠","start_index":43,"tongjian_id":"b8f8eafa-db0e-11ef-b20b-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"延陀","people_name_jianti_auto":"延陀","start_index":46,"tongjian_id":"b8f8eafb-db0e-11ef-a474-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"眞珠","people_name_jianti_auto":"真珠","start_index":51,"tongjian_id":"b8f8eafc-db0e-11ef-85f5-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"太宗","people_name_jianti_auto":"太宗","start_index":54,"tongjian_id":"b8f8eafd-db0e-11ef-8d09-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"眞珠","people_name_jianti_auto":"真珠","start_index":79,"tongjian_id":"b8f8eafe-db0e-11ef-b674-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"磧，七迹翻。還，從宣翻，又如字。考異曰：高宗實錄云：「會延陀死，耀威漠北而還。」其意指眞珠爲延陀也。按眞珠憚太宗威靈，不敢入寇，又死在九月；而此云冬來寇，必非眞珠也。田仁會傳作十八年，亦誤也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"碛，七迹翻。还，从宣翻，又如字。考异曰：高宗实录云：「会延陀死，耀威漠北而还。」其意指真珠为延陀也。按真珠惮太宗威灵，不敢入寇，又死在九月；而此云冬来寇，必非真珠也。田仁会传作十八年，亦误也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":120,"tongjian_id":"b8f8eaf8-db0e-11ef-8823-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"幷州","place_