e_jianti_auto":"定襄县","start_index":139,"tongjian_id":"b8f8eb25-db0e-11ef-a70d-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"雲中縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"云中县","start_index":143,"tongjian_id":"b8f8eb26-db0e-11ef-9c2e-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"武德三年，分幷州之樂平、遼山、平城、石艾置遼州樂平郡；八年，改曰箕州。後周置蔚州於漢代郡之靈丘，隋廢州，以靈丘縣屬肆州；唐武德六年，分肆州之靈丘、易州之飛狐地置蔚州。雲州，雲中郡，貞觀十四年自朔州北定襄城徙治定襄縣，其地實隋馬邑郡之雲內縣恆安鎭，卽後魏所都平城也。開元十八年，改定襄縣爲雲中縣。蔚，紆勿翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"武德三年，分幷州之乐平、辽山、平城、石艾置辽州乐平郡；八年，改曰箕州。后周置蔚州于汉代郡之灵丘，隋废州，以灵丘县属肆州；唐武德六年，分肆州之灵丘、易州之飞狐地置蔚州。云州，云中郡，贞观十四年自朔州北定襄城徙治定襄县，其地实隋马邑郡之云内县恒安镇，即后魏所都平城也。开元十八年，改定襄县为云中县。蔚，纡勿翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":168,"tongjian_id":"b8f8eb03-db0e-11ef-a8a5-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"杜佑","people_name_jianti_auto":"杜佑","start_index":67,"tongjian_id":"b8f8eb28-db0e-11ef-82c3-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"姚興","people_name_jianti_auto":"姚兴","start_index":166,"tongjian_id":"b8f8eb29-db0e-11ef-bf72-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"元皇帝","people_name_jianti_auto":"元皇帝","start_index":214,"tongjian_id":"b8f8eb2a-db0e-11ef-9925-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"勝州","place_name_jianti_auto":"胜州","place_note":"总部设内蒙古托克托县","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"b8f8eb2b-db0e-11ef-8d2b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"隋","place_name_jianti_auto":"隋","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"b8f8eb2c-db0e-11ef-b1db-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"榆林郡","place_name_jianti_auto":"榆林郡","start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"b8f8eb2d-db0e-11ef-91e5-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"後魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"后魏","start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"b8f8eb2e-db0e-11ef-9333-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"銀州","place_name_jianti_auto":"银州","start_index":13,"tongjian_id":"b8f8eb2f-db0e-11ef-a1ac-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"隋","place_name_jianti_auto":"隋","start_index":16,"tongjian_id":"b8f8eb30-db0e-11ef-b75b-a0d3651f611f"}